      {
        "heading": "Executive summary",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Cuba’s estimated median household income is $58,750, compared with $86,636 in Sandoval County and $64,059 statewide. Cuba’s estimated electric-heating share (22.6%) is higher than the county’s (13.0%) and close to the state’s (23.3%). These are descriptive comparisons, not evidence of causation or statistical significance."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
